body:
The bikeshed source makes this confusing here. The _settings_ variable _is_ the relevant settings object (for _this_) captured in step 1 of the algorithm, which is an environment settings object. The `[=environment settings object/API base URL=]` reference is to the definition of API base URL for an environment settings object.

In pseudo C++ this would be:

EnvironmentSettingsObject* settings = this->RelevantSettingsObject();
...
auto parsed = URL::Parse(options["url"], settings->APIBaseURL());
